{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n めんどくさいから\n 携帯を逆向きでいじってたら\n 変な目で見られちゃいましたYO(｡･ω･｡)\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11NZWVS502GE8XG9MCZ3AB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 実はプチ旅行に行ってた私。\n 瀬戸内海生まれて初めてみました！！！\n \n 暑かったな〜〜夏を感じた\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P0VV86TXRF3XV63N8FRH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 海をバックに目つぶりがち\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P1VEK6G1DV9DND33ZPN9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P2WNZG16DKYZWT72TB31","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n すっごく晴れてたから影も濃くて、\n 写真撮るのが楽しかったです( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )\n \n \n すーーーーっごく魅力的な看板があって、\n 写真に残せて嬉しかったー、！！\n \n 実はキラキラの海も猫ちゃんもここで撮ったものでした！\n \n 自分の撮った写真を見てニヤニヤしちゃう☺︎\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P3XBW48SVYRCGG0458XF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n よきかな(・ω・)ノ？\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11P4X446RA0DK8NNMPZ965","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 旅先でデススターを見つけたのでした。\n \n \n \n \n ではまたね(　˙-˙　)/\n \n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}